On-device AI means that AI models (like machine learning programs) run directly on your device (like a smartphone, computer, or smart home device) instead of needing to send data to the cloud or a server. This means the AI can process information quickly and make decisions in real time without relying on internet connections. For example, a camera with on-device AI can recognize faces in photos without sending them to the cloud. This approach keeps data private and allows faster, smarter actions on your device.

